# UAE Trail homepage rules
- Stack: React 18, TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind CSS, Vitest. No new libs without asking.
- Theme: green/white. Only tokens from `src/styles/home-tokens.css` on guest `/`; no hard-coded colors/sizes.
- One component per file under `src/components/home/marketing/` (guest homepage); typed props; compose on guest `/` only.
- Accessibility: semantic HTML, keyboard support, visible focus, alt text, contrast >= 4.5:1,
  respect prefers-reduced-motion.
- Images: real <img> with alt, width/height or aspect-ratio, lazy except the first hero slide.
- Time format: formatActivityTime() everywhere.
- Copy comes from `src/content/homeMarketing.ts` and `src/content/productNorthStar.ts`; do not invent testimonial names.
- Mobile-first; verify 360/768/1024/1440.
- Before large edits, present a file-by-file plan and wait for approval.